    "title": "Kaya's School Trip Memory",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya thought about her amazing school trip to Hawaii.",
      "They took an airplane, arriving at 2 p.m.",
      "First, a brave tour showed her a monkey, fox, and koala.",
      "She also saw a horse, sheep, pig, and running mouse.",
      "At the amusement park, she heard such a loud scream.",
      "The sky was quite cloudy, but she felt free.",
      "She loved the swimming pool and playing dodge ball.",
      "She ate chicken and bought a special seasoning.",
      "She spent a million yen, filling her suitcase.",
      "She took a photograph, not scared to answer.",
      "She remembered hiking, arts and crafts, and calligraphy.",
      "Her friends enjoyed rugby, skiing, and a concert."
    ]
  }
